  "description": "Lightweight, triple-butted alloy hardtail frame with smooth internal cable routing, BOOST hub spacing, dropper-post compatibility, and modern XC/down-country geometry.\n\nRockShox Judy Silver TK SoloAir fork with 120 mm travel delivers trail comfort, control, and responsiveness—no compromise on speed.\n\nShimano Deore 1×12 drivetrain ensures crisp, reliable shifting across a wide gear range, perfect for technical climbs and fast descents.\n\nKS E-20i remote dropper post (120 mm) lets you shift your center of gravity instantly for better handling on aggressive terrain.\n\nHydraulic Shimano Deore disc brakes with 180 mm rotors provide confident, consistent stopping power no matter the conditions.\n\nPurpose-built for serious fun, the Trigger 7.5 blends lightweight XC agility with trail-ready features that invite you to ride hard and fast.",
